5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about timelines slipping. Let us look at delivery schedules and weather diaries.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I care about how rooms are actually used. I want booking data and timetable records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The staff are stretched thin. I need to see staffing posts and manual routines.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We must know if past projects satisfied users. I will check post-occupancy ratings and survey findings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Paper budgets lie. I need tender records and renewal reserves to see real costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, do you think the reserves cover the unexpected delays we always face?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, if the ratings are low, does that mean the space was poorly designed?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shizue, weather delays hurt the technicians most. They have to rush to catch up.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Yumi, not always. Sometimes the design is fine, but the maintenance was neglected.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shizue, reserves are static. Market inflation is not. We need to see the tender history.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Inflation makes every week of delay cost more. I will check the delivery schedules.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,That makes sense. I will look at the booking data to see which rooms are overbooked.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"I will examine the staffing posts. If we are underfunded, no plan will work.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will review the post-occupancy ratings. We cannot repeat past mistakes blindly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will analyze the tender records. The gap between bid and final cost is the key.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Thank you all. Let us see what the data says before we decide.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I hope the numbers show us where the real pressure points are.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I just hope we find a way to lighten the load on the crew.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I trust the data will guide us to a choice that truly serves the campus.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic over hope. Let us see the figures.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
